{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are a stranger in this world. And you will remain a stranger forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey across the endless ocean, where every island holds both danger and opportunity. Build a floating fortress, assemble your crew, explore lost lands, and battle ancient creatures lurking in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong><br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Raft Survival</strong> \u2013 build, upgrade, and defend your floating home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/Build_Your_Own_Raft.gif?t=1744464972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Island Exploration</strong> \u2013 gather resources, uncover secrets, and encounter local inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/Different_Biomes.gif?t=1744464972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694 <strong>Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 fight against mythical beasts guarding the rarest treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/Defeat_Different_Bosses.gif?t=1744464972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Crafting &amp; Resource Management</strong> \u2013 create gear, upgrade weapons, and manage your crew.<br>\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Crew Recruitment</strong> \u2013 gather allies, train them, and send them on missions.<br>\ud83c\udfda <strong>Slave Villages &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 enslave islanders, force them to gather resources, construct buildings, and strengthen your control over the islands. Upgrade settlements to increase production and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you prove that even a stranger can survive? Or will the ocean claim you like all those before you?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537680?t=1744464972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/baf0a4fe4cf577dcc3a20e894248c1ddbe40fb9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744464972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/ac1206322548e929abf0cf3350bf905c01e02160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744464972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/ac1206322548e929abf0cf3350bf905c01e02160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744464972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are a stranger in this world. And you will remain a stranger forever.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey across the endless ocean, where every island holds both danger and opportunity. Build a floating fortress, assemble your crew, explore lost lands, and battle ancient creatures lurking in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong><br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Raft Survival</strong> \u2013 build, upgrade, and defend your floating home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537680/extras/Build_Your_Own_Raft.gif?t=1744464972\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Island Exploration</strong> \u2013 gather resources, uncover secrets, and encounter local inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a